 * [[File:Dota2 Dazzle Poison Touch Visualization icon-1.png|105px|]][[File:Dota2 Dazzle Poison Touch Visualization icon-2.png|105px|]]
** Can affect enemy units up to {{Symbol|bonus cas}} {{Symbol|bonus aoe}} {{calc|{{#var:Poison Touch value1}}+v1+{{#var:Poison Touch value3}}|v1={{#var:Poison Touch value2}}}}-distance away with the travel distance and end radius.
*** The ability's starts at Dazzle's current position [[File:Dota2 Letter-o.png|21px|O]] {{Symbol|Facing Angle|r}}, with the first radius extending to point [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|21px|P]] .
**** The total ability [[area-of-effect]] is cone-shaped.
**** {{Code|OP {{=}} {{#var:Poison Touch value1}}}}
**** {{Code|PQ {{=}} {{#var:Poison Touch value2}}}}
*** Circle [[File:Dota2 Letter-q.png|21px|Q]] is the end radius.
** Units closest to the {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted enemy [[File:Dota2 Letter-q.png|21px|Q]] has priority within the area-of-effect.

* The ability effects are applied as follows upon {{M|projectile}} impact:
*# {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|dazzle_poison_touch}}
*#* The debuff applied has five main components:
*#** [[File:Dota2 Condition-1.png|1|21px]] {{Symbol|Damage|Physical}} {{Symbol|Spell Damage}}
*#*** Deals [[physical]] [[spell damage]] in 1-second intervals, starting immediately upon the damage per second debuff application, over {{calc|v1+1|v1={{#var:Poison Touch type1 value4}}}} instances.
*#** Both leveling the ability and the {{ValueColor||spell damage increasing|20tal}} {{M|talent|t=t3l}} immediately update the current instance.
*#** All debuff values are updated and refresh correspondingly to its current ability level.
*#** Reapplying the debuff creates an independent instance and ability intervals.
*#* [[File:Dota2 Condition-2.png|2|21px]] {{Symbol|Move Speed}} {{Symbol|a|down}}
*#** Neither leveling the ability nor the {{ValueColor||slow increasing|25tal}} {{M|talent|t=t4r|x}} update the current instance.
*#** The {{ValueColor||slow increasing|25tal}} {{M|talent|t=t4r|x}} only affects the first movement speed slow values.
*#* [[File:Dota2 Condition-3.png|3|21px]] {{Symbol|Deny}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
*#** The enemy's allied unit [[deny]] component considers {{M|clones}} and the {{H|Spirit Bear}} as heroes, {{M|illusions}} and other {{M|creep-heroes}} as creeps.
*#* [[File:Dota2 Condition-4.png|4|21px]] {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
*#** Only successful attacks of Dazzle's can refresh and extend the duration of all applied debuffs.
*#** {{cf|talnotes}} The {{ValueColor||bonus attack range|10tal}} {{M|talent|t=t1r}} grants additional {{M|attack range}} upon Dazzle's {{M|attack point}}.
*#*** Grants the flat attack range bonus as long as Dazzle is attacking the units affected by Poison Touch, regardless of its source.
*#*** Does not interact with the following sources:
*#**** Dazzle's {{M|illusions}}.
*#**** Attacks that cannot proc {{M|attack modifier}} sources.
*# {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{A|Dazzle|Weave}}
*# {{A|Dazzle|Nothl Projection}} {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|modifier_[[hex]]xed}}
*#* Considers {{M|strong illusions}} as heroes.
*#* Applies the following ability effects on the debuff-affected enemy unit(s):
*#** {{M|Disarm}}
*#** [[Movement Speed#Set Movement Speed|Sets]] its base {{M|movement speed}} to {{#var:Poison Touch type3 value1}}.
*#** {{M|Mute}}
*#** {{M|Silence}}
*#** {{Symbol|Selection Box}}
*#*** Changes the [[selection box]] correspondingly to the Hex model.
*#*** Neither affects the unit's {{M|collision size}} nor {{M|bound radius}}.

