 * This ability has two main components:
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-1.png|21px|1]] {{Symbol|Armor|Bonus}}
*** The [[bonus armor]] granting and reduction component only works with Dazzle's abilities.
*** Applies the following amount of Weave stacks:
**** {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
***** 1 stack per {{A|Dazzle|Poison Touch}} affected unit upon {{Symbol|Projectile|Impact}} [[projectile]] impact.
***** {{A|Dazzle|Shadow Wave}}
****** 1 stack per {{M|spell damage}}-affected unit, this includes enemy units that are within the damage radius of multiple healed allied units.
****** {{Symbol|bonus agh}} Does not apply to the {{M|instant attack}} component.
**** {{Symbol|Affect|Ally}}
***** 1 stack per {{A|Dazzle|Shadow Wave}} {{M|heal}}-affected allied unit.
***** 1 stack per {{A|Dazzle|Shallow Grave}} {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted cast.
**** {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
***** 1 stack per {{A|Dazzle|Shadow Wave}} cast
*** Affects the following units:
**** {{M|Couriers}}
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-2.png|21px|2]] {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|dazzle_innate_weave_armor_counter}}
*** Each stack places a new buff or debuff on the allied or enemy unit repsectively, with each duration independent of the other.
*** {{cf|talnotes}}
**** Learning the {{ValueColor||bonus armor and reduction|25tal}} value {{M|talent|t=t4l}} does not update current active stacks.
**** However, reapplying the stack updates all values immediately.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Weave icon0}}
| desc = Dazzle's abilities apply Weave to both allies and enemies they affect, increasing allied armor and reducing enemy armor. Multiple instances of this effect stack.
}}
* The ability effects are applied as follows:
*# Applies or increases the Weave {{M|bonus armor}} stack by 1.
*# The ability cast.

