 * The ability effects are applied as follows:
*# {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
*#* Applies the following ability effects on self upon cast:
*#** {{M|Stun}}
*#** {{M|Phase movement}}.
*# {{Symbol|Clone}} {{Symbol|Projectile|Travel}}
*#* 0.2 seconds after cast, the ability creates a [[clone]] at Dazzle current location, and travels to the {{Symbol|Target|Point}} point-targeted location in {{#var:Nothl Projection basic1}}-speed, within {{Symbol|bonus cas}} {{#expr:{{#var:Nothl Projection cast range}}/{{#var:Nothl Projection basic1}}}} seconds.
*#* The Shadow Clone has the following properties:
*#** Cannot attack {{M|buildings}}.
*#** {{M|Attack immune}}
*#** {{M|Cooldown reduction}} for all {{A|Dazzle|Shadow Wave}} casts while active.
*#** {{M|Hidden}}
*#** {{M|Invulnerable}}
*#** {{M|Phase movement}} with {{M|tree-walking}}.
*#** {{M|Untargetable}}
*#** Can cast all of Dazzle's abilities, including item abilities, except for {{A|Hand of Midas|Transmute}}.
*#** Does not interact with {{M|experience}}.
*#** {{Symbol|fx|v}}
*#*** Visually distinguishable from the original hero and has a link to the affected hero visible to everyone.
*#* The clone has the following properties of Dazzle upon summon:
*#** All current {{M|attributes}} and abilities.
*#** Has the following modifiers:
*#*** {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{A|Moon Shard|Consume}}
*#*** All {{Symbol|bonus agh}} {{Symbol|bonus shd}} {{Symbol|bonus t-all}} ability upgrades.
*#* Does not copy the following properties of the affected hero:
*#** Permanent {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} buff and {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} debuff modifiers.
*# {{Symbol|bonus cd}}
*#* All ability [[cooldown]]s are then transferred to Dazzle.

